  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Flash Enchantment Spell. All nearby foes are struck for 10...34...40 earth damage. For 30 seconds, your attacks deal earth damage. When this enchantment ends, all nearby foes are Blinded for 1...3...4 second[s].",
